{"id":112,"name":"上世纪老片拾遗","movieIds":[37,42,1272,74,722,1485,979,895,1296,331,732,823,924,405,949,1284,1490,954,1335,755,890,1444,1218,1313,1301,777,934,131,834,905],"detail":{"imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2561716440.webp"},"moviesList":[{"id":37,"title":"霸王别姬","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2561716440.webp","tag":"No.2豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆 / 中国香港","years":"1993","date":"1993-07-26(中国大陆)、1993-01-01(中国香港)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1665762739.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581065129.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1949228542.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p504397690.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p950669794.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2561716440.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2585897495.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p452855329.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2591403415.webp\"]","descs":"段小楼（张丰毅）与程蝶衣（张国荣）是一对打小一起长大的师兄弟，两人一个演生，一个饰旦，一向配合天衣无缝，尤其一出《霸王别姬》，更是誉满京城，为此，两人约定合演一辈子《霸王别姬》。但两人对戏剧与人生关系的理解有本质不同，段小楼深知戏非人生，程蝶衣则是人戏不分。\n　　段小楼在认为该成家立业之时迎娶了名妓菊仙（巩俐），致使程蝶衣认定菊仙是可耻的第三者，使段小楼做了叛徒，自此，三人围绕一出《霸王别姬》生出的爱恨情仇战开始随着时代风云的变迁不断升级，终酿成悲剧。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/16CErdwtxBKQduPqacq4RRg?pwd=6t6p\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":42,"title":"泰坦尼克号 Titanic","ratingNum":9.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p45